{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PG6naFM5H5AQ1SxpF7eFCW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '从 \"diversity never helps\" 软化为 \"individual robustness is the dominant\n2\t  factor; diversity provides marginal benefit only when individual robustness is already\n3\t  high\"。 Title 用 \"The Weakest Link\" 而非 \"The Diversity Trap\"。Claim 2 区分 capability-homogeneous\n4\t  vs heterogeneous regime，承认前者中 diversity 有边际作用。Claim 6 从 formal algorithm 降级为 guideline。补充\n5\t  \"when does diversity help\" 的 ablation (plan_004) 堵 reviewer concern。 核心 negative\n6\t  result + adaptive adversary bound + regime analysis 仍构成 EMNLP contribution stack，\n7\t  但叙事需更 nuanced，不能 overclaim。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n14\t    Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B）。在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n15\t    上重跑 MI matrix 和 multivariate regression。2 datasets × 3 attacks = 6 conditions。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    total_panels: 455\n20\t    total_mi_pairs: 105\n21\t    eta_max_sig_count: 5\n22\t    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n23\t    eta_max_median_beta: 0.52\n24\t    keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n25\t    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n26\t    keff_nonsig_count: 4\n27\t    keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n28\t    keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.12\n29\t    median_R2: 0.38\n30\t    R2_eta_only: 0.34\n31\t    R2_increment_from_keff: 0.04\n32\t    copula_underestimate_median: 42\n33\t    copula_underestimate_range_lo: 8\n34\t    copula_underestimate_range_hi: 210\n35\t    family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.12\n36\t    keff_eta_max_r_overall: -0.65\n37\t  result_rationale: 'N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了极大的统计功效提升。η_max 在 MVP 中已 4/6 显著，\n38\t    扩大样本量后即使效果量不变也更容易达到显著性，因此升至 5/6。但 median 档非 100%： ARC×sycophancy 条件下 η_max 方差在\n39\t    API 模型中被压缩（API 模型 η_max 整体偏低且聚集）， 导致该条件下 η_max 效应被稀释（p ≈ 0.07）。K_eff 在 MVP 中 1/6\n40\t    显著负（arc×sycophancy）， 扩展后高功效检测到弱效应：MMLU×prompt_injection 中 K_eff 呈弱显著负（β=-0.12,\n41\t    p=0.03）， 但标准化效应量仅为 η_max 的 1/4。同时 MMLU×position 中 K_eff 出现与 MVP 一致的异常 正效应（p=0.04），原因是\n42\t    position bias 在高多样性 panel 中反而触发更多 judge 的 共享 bias。API 模型引入新现象：GPT-4o/Claude/Gemini\n43\t    三者个体鲁棒性都高（η_max 低）， 它们组成的 panel 中 η_max 方差被压缩，K_eff 的边际效应变得可检测。Copula 中位数从 MVP\n44\t    的 10-21× 变为 42×，因为 API 模型间的高阶依赖（共享训练数据 distribution） 比开源模型间更强，但 Gaussian copula\n45\t    仍然无法捕捉。Family label 测试 p=0.12：新增 5 个 API 模型（理论上 5 个不同 family）推高了 cross-family\n46\t    样本量，但 API 模型间 MI 反而偏高（共享训练 paradigm），导致 within vs cross-family 区分依然不显著。\n47\t\n48\t    '\n49\t  tables:\n50\t  - name: 'Table 2: Multivariate Regression on 455 Panels (15 Models)'\n51\t    columns:\n52\t    - Condition\n53\t    - β(η_max)\n54\t    - p(η_max)\n55\t    - β(K_eff)\n56\t    - p(K_eff)\n57\t    - R²\n58\t    - ΔR²(+K_eff)\n59\t    rows:\n60\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n61\t      - '0.58'\n62\t      - '0.001'\n63\t      - '-0.12'\n64\t      - '0.031'\n65\t      - '0.41'\n66\t      - '+0.04'\n67\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n68\t      - '0.51'\n69\t      - '0.003'\n70\t      - '-0.06'\n71\t      - '0.218'\n72\t      - '0.36'\n73\t      - '+0.01'\n74\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n75\t      - '0.47'\n76\t      - <0.001\n77\t      - '-0.04'\n78\t      - '0.412'\n79\t      - '0.35'\n80\t      - '+0.00'\n81\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n82\t      - '0.55'\n83\t      - <0.001\n84\t      - '-0.08'\n85\t      - '0.089'\n86\t      - '0.39'\n87\t      - '+0.02'\n88\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n89\t      - '0.49'\n90\t      - '0.005'\n91\t      - '-0.05'\n92\t      - '0.287'\n93\t      - '0.34'\n94\t      - '+0.01'\n95\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n96\t      - '0.44'\n97\t      - '0.072'\n98\t      - '-0.15'\n99\t      - '0.008'\n100\t      - '0.42'\n101\t      - '+0.06'\n102\t  - name: 'Table 3: Copula Underestimation Ratio (15-model MI Matrix)'\n103\t    columns:\n104\t    - Model Pair Type\n105\t    - N pairs\n106\t    - Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\n107\t    - Range\n108\t    rows:\n109\t    - - Open-source × Open-source\n110\t      - '15'\n111\t      - 28×\n112\t      - 8-145×\n113\t    - - API × API\n114\t      - '10'\n115\t      - 68×\n116\t      - 32-210×\n117\t    - - Open-source × API\n118\t      - '80'\n119\t      - 41×\n120\t      - 12-180×\n121\t    - - Overall\n122\t      - '105'\n123\t      - 42×\n124\t      - 8-210×\n125\t  figures_description:\n126\t  - 'Fig 2a: Scatter plot of η_max vs K_eff for 455 panels, color-coded by capability\n127\t    tier (7B/14-32B/70B/API). Clear negative slope (r=-0.65) with API-only panels\n128\t    forming a distinct cluster in the low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.'\n129\t  - 'Fig 2b: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability rather\n130\t    than family. API models cluster together despite different families. Diagonal\n131\t    blocks correspond to capability tiers, not model families.'\n132\t  analysis: '核心发现：η_max 仍然是主导预测因子（5/6 条件显著），但 K_eff 不再是完全无关—— 在 1/6 条件中呈弱显著负效应（diversity\n133\t    有边际帮助）。关键 nuance：K_eff 显著的条件 恰好是 η_max 方差最大的条件（arc×sycophancy，R²=0.42），提示当个体鲁棒性差异大时\n134\t    diversity 的边际价值才可检测。API 模型引入 \"全强 regime\"：在这个 regime 中 weakest-link 效应减弱（因为没有明显\n135\t    weak link），diversity 的边际效应变得相对更重要。这要求论文 叙事从 \"diversity never helps\" 转为 \"diversity''s\n136\t    marginal benefit is dominated by and conditional on individual robustness\"。Copula\n137\t    失败结论进一步加强（中位 42× vs MVP 的 10-21×），特别是 API 模型间的 68× 中位数表明这些模型共享比开源模型更强的 隐性依赖。ΔR²\n138\t    分析是关键防守数据：加入 K_eff 后 R² 平均仅提升 0.02，最高 0.06， 表明 diversity 的解释力在统计显著的条件下也很有限。\n139\t\n140\t    '\n141\t- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n142\t  plan_id: plan_002\n143\t  description: '在 plan_001 的 15 模型池基础上新增 few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation,\n144\t    instruction override 三种攻击。总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 12 conditions， 455 panels/condition。验证\n145\t    weakest-link 跨攻击面普适性。\n146\t\n147\t    '\n148\t  expected_results:\n149\t    total_conditions: 12\n150\t    eta_max_sig_count: 8\n151\t    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n152\t    keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n153\t    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n154\t    keff_nonsig_count: 9\n155\t    keff_nonsig_rate: 0.75\n156\t    keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.14\n157\t    eta_max_median_beta: 0.48\n158\t    median_R2: 0.36\n159\t    new_attack_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n160\t    new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n161\t  result_rationale: '新攻击类型中，few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是典型 targeted\n162\t    attack， η_max 效应强（β≈0.55-0.60），K_eff 无关——攻击者直接针对最弱 judge 的 instruction following\n163\t    缺陷，diversity 无法对冲。Persona manipulation 是唯一例外：该攻击利用 judge 对 authority/persona 的响应差异，不同模型的\n164\t    persona susceptibility 分布更均匀 （不像 prompt injection 那样集中在弱模型），导致 η_max 效应减弱（p≈0.08-0.12），\n165\t    K_eff 在 ARC×persona 中呈弱显著负（p=0.04）。这解释了为什么 8/12 而非 12/12 η_max 显著：4 个不显著条件中 3\n166\t    个涉及 persona manipulation（2 个 dataset）和 ARC×sycophancy （延续 plan_001 趋势），1 个是 MMLU×authority（边缘\n167\t    p=0.06）。新攻击整体 η_max 显著率（3/6=0.50）低于原有攻击（5/6=0.83），因为 few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU\n168\t    上 所有模型 ASR 都很高（ceiling effect，η_max 方差被压缩），persona manipulation 如上述。 K_eff 在新攻击中仅\n169\t    1/6 显著负——targeted attack 本质上不给 diversity 发挥空间。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t  tables:\n173\t  - name: 'Table 4: Regression Summary Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels)'\n174\t    columns:\n175\t    - Attack Type\n176\t    - Dataset\n177\t    - β(η_max)\n178\t    - p(η_max)\n179\t    - β(K_eff)\n180\t    - p(K_eff)\n181\t    - R²\n182\t    rows:\n183\t    - - prompt_injection\n184\t      - MMLU\n185\t      - '0.58'\n186\t      - '0.001'\n187\t      - '-0.12'\n188\t      - '0.031'\n189\t      - '0.41'\n190\t    - - prompt_injection\n191\t      - ARC\n192\t      - '0.55'\n193\t      - <0.001\n194\t      - '-0.08'\n195\t      - '0.089'\n196\t      - '0.39'\n197\t    - - score_manipulation\n198\t      - MMLU\n199\t      - '0.51'\n200\t      - '0.003'\n201\t      - '-0.06'\n202\t      - '0.218'\n203\t      - '0.36'\n204\t    - - score_manipulation\n205\t      - ARC\n206\t      - '0.49'\n207\t      - '0.005'\n208\t      - '-0.05'\n209\t      - '0.287'\n210\t      - '0.34'\n211\t    - - sycophancy\n212\t      - MMLU\n213\t      - '0.47'\n214\t      - <0.001\n215\t      - '-0.04'\n216\t      - '0.412'\n217\t      - '0.35'\n218\t    - - sycophancy\n219\t      - ARC\n220\t      - '0.44'\n221\t      - '0.072'\n222\t      - '-0.15'\n223\t      - '0.008'\n224\t      - '0.42'\n225\t    - - few_shot_hijack\n226\t      - MMLU\n227\t      - '0.32'\n228\t      - '0.118'\n229\t      - '-0.03'\n230\t      - '0.605'\n231\t      - '0.18'\n232\t    - - few_shot_hijack\n233\t      - ARC\n234\t      - '0.57'\n235\t      - '0.002'\n236\t      - '-0.07'\n237\t      - '0.154'\n238\t      - '0.38'\n239\t    - - persona_manip\n240\t      - MMLU\n241\t      - '0.38'\n242\t      - '0.085'\n243\t      - '-0.11'\n244\t      - '0.062'\n245\t      - '0.28'\n246\t    - - persona_manip\n247\t      - ARC\n248\t      - '0.35'\n249\t      - '0.108'\n250\t      - '-0.16'\n251\t      - '0.038'\n252\t      - '0.30'\n253\t    - - instruction_override\n254\t      - MMLU\n255\t      - '0.60'\n256\t      - <0.001\n257\t      - '-0.05'\n258\t      - '0.321'\n259\t      - '0.43'\n260\t    - - instruction_override\n261\t      - ARC\n262\t      - '0.53'\n263\t      - '0.004'\n264\t      - '0.09'\n265\t      - '0.047'\n266\t      - '0.37'\n267\t  figures_description:\n268\t  - 'Fig 3: Forest plot of standardized β coefficients for η_max (blue) and K_eff\n269\t    (red) across 12 conditions. η_max consistently positive and large; K_eff scattered\n270\t    around zero with occasional weak negative values. Error bars (95% CI) for K_eff\n271\t    cross zero in 9/12 conditions.'\n272\t  analysis: 'Attack expansion 确认 weakest-link 在大多数攻击类型下成立，但揭示了 attack-type 异质性： targeted\n273\t    attacks（prompt_injection, instruction_override）η_max 效应最强（β>0.50）， broad-spectrum\n274\t    attacks（sycophancy, persona_manipulation）效应减弱。Few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU 上出现 ceiling\n275\t    effect（所有模型 ASR>0.7），是方法论警告而非反例。 Persona manipulation 是论文中需要 explicitly address\n276\t    的边界条件：当攻击不 adaptive-target weakest judge 而是均匀影响所有 judge 时，diversity 确实有边际作用。这恰好支持\n277\t    Claim 2（BFT distinction）——persona manipulation 更接近 \"random fault\" 模式， K_eff 的边际显著正好验证了理论预测。论文策略：将\n278\t    persona manipulation 作为 \"when does diversity help\" section 的核心案例。instruction_override\n279\t    在 ARC 上 K_eff 异常正（p=0.04）需要报告但解释为 confound：高 K_eff panels 恰好包含更多 API 模型（instruction\n280\t    following 强），K_eff 和 capability 在该 subset 中混淆。\n281\t\n282\t    '\n283\t- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n284\t  plan_id: plan_003\n285\t  description: '(a) 形式化证明 adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)； (b) 实现 random-fault\n286\t    simulation（每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败）； (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault 下 K_eff 的预测力，验证\n287\t    BFT distinction。 在 6 original conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001）。\n288\t\n289\t    '\n290\t  expected_results:\n291\t    theorem_bound: panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\n292\t    bound_tightness: within factor 1.3 of empirical\n293\t    rf_keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n294\t    rf_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n295\t    rf_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n296\t    rf_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n297\t    adaptive_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n298\t    randomfault_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n299\t    contrast_cohen_d: 0.62\n300\t    contrast_direction: correct\n301\t    keff_beta_shift_mean: -0.35\n302\t    keff_beta_shift_range_lo: -0.18\n303\t    keff_beta_shift_range_hi: -0.52\n304\t  result_rationale: 'Formal theorem: adaptive adversary 选择 argmax_j ASR_j，因此 panel\n305\t    在 majority vote 下的 ASR 受限于攻击者能否翻转 ≥ceil(K/2) 个 judge。Adaptive adversary 最优策略是\n306\t    先攻破最弱 judge，再依次攻击次弱 judge。因此 panel_ASR 主要项为 η_max，次要项为 ordered statistics 的衰减——当\n307\t    K 增大时次弱 judge 的鲁棒性提供对数级修正， 给出 η_max·(1+ε·log(K)) 上界。在 median 档，empirical ASR 不完美吻合理论上界\n308\t    （within factor 1.3 而非 optimistic 档的 1.1），因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive—— 有些攻击（sycophancy）对所有\n309\t    judge 都有一定效果，不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n310\t\n311\t    Random-fault simulation: 将每个 judge 的 failure 建模为独立 Bernoulli(p_j)， p_j 取自 empirical\n312\t    ASR。在此设定下 K_eff 显著负（4/6 条件），因为独立失败下 增加独立 judge 确实降低 panel 失败概率（BFT 有效）。η_max 仅在\n313\t    2/6 条件中显著， 因为 random fault 下攻击不集中在最弱 judge——每个 judge 的贡献更均匀。\n314\t\n315\t    Cohen''s d = 0.62（中等效应量）而非 optimistic 的 >0.8，原因：在 sycophancy 和 persona-like 条件下，实际攻击本身就有\n316\t    random-fault 成分（bias 影响所有 judge）， 导致 adaptive vs random-fault 区分度降低。但 d=0.62 仍足以支持\n317\t    \"distinct regimes\" 论点。 Reviewer 可能要求 confidence interval——95% CI 为 [0.28, 0.96]，下界\n318\t    >0 但偏宽， 论文需要 acknowledge 这一点。\n319\t\n320\t    '\n321\t  tables:\n322\t  - name: 'Table 5: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime Comparison'\n323\t    columns:\n324\t    - Condition\n325\t    - β(K_eff) Adaptive\n326\t    - p Adaptive\n327\t    - β(K_eff) Random-Fault\n328\t    - p Random-Fault\n329\t    - Δβ\n330\t    rows:\n331\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n332\t      - '-0.12'\n333\t      - '0.031'\n334\t      - '-0.48'\n335\t      - '0.002'\n336\t      - '-0.36'\n337\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n338\t      - '-0.06'\n339\t      - '0.218'\n340\t      - '-0.41'\n341\t      - '0.008'\n342\t      - '-0.35'\n343\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n344\t      - '-0.04'\n345\t      - '0.412'\n346\t      - '-0.22'\n347\t      - '0.078'\n348\t      - '-0.18'\n349\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n350\t      - '-0.08'\n351\t      - '0.089'\n352\t      - '-0.52'\n353\t      - <0.001\n354\t      - '-0.44'\n355\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n356\t      - '-0.05'\n357\t      - '0.287'\n358\t      - '-0.38'\n359\t      - '0.015'\n360\t      - '-0.33'\n361\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n362\t      - '-0.15'\n363\t      - '0.008'\n364\t      - '-0.47'\n365\t      - '0.003'\n366\t      - '-0.32'\n367\t  - name: 'Table 6: BFT Contrast Summary Statistics'\n368\t    columns:\n369\t    - Metric\n370\t    - Adaptive\n371\t    - Random-Fault\n372\t    - Cohen's d\n373\t    - 95% CI\n374\t    rows:\n375\t    - - K_eff sig rate\n376\t      - '0.17'\n377\t      - '0.67'\n378\t      - —\n379\t      - —\n380\t    - - Mean |β(K_eff)|\n381\t      - '0.08'\n382\t      - '0.41'\n383\t      - '0.62'\n384\t      - '[0.28, 0.96]'\n385\t    - - Mean R²\n386\t      - '0.38'\n387\t      - '0.44'\n388\t      - —\n389\t      - —\n390\t    - - η_max sig rate\n391\t      - '0.83'\n392\t      - '0.33'\n393\t      - —\n394\t      - —\n395\t  figures_description:\n396\t  - 'Fig 4a: Paired bar chart showing β(K_eff) under adaptive (light) vs random-fault\n397\t    (dark) regime for each of 6 conditions. Random-fault bars consistently more negative.\n398\t    Significance markers (* for p<0.05) appear on 4/6 random-fault bars but only 1/6\n399\t    adaptive bars.'\n400\t  - 'Fig 4b: Schematic illustrating adaptive adversary targeting strategy (attack\n401\t    concentrates on weakest judge) vs random-fault (attacks distributed uniformly).\n402\t    Arrows show information flow from adversary to judges.'\n403\t  analysis: 'BFT distinction 是论文的理论核心，median 档下 Cohen''s d=0.62 提供了 \"moderate\" 级别证据——\n404\t    足以论证两种 regime 在统计上可区分，但不足以宣称 dramatic difference。论文策略： (1) 报告 d=0.62 和宽 CI，honest\n405\t    地说这是 moderate effect；(2) 用 sycophancy 条件 作为 \"bridge case\"——该攻击同时具有 adaptive 和\n406\t    random 成分，恰好在两种 regime 间 过渡；(3) 理论贡献不依赖 effect size——theorem 本身是 worst-case bound，即使实际\n407\t    攻击不完全 adaptive，bound 仍有效。Reviewer 若 push back on effect size，可回应 \"our theorem\n408\t    provides a security guarantee; the moderate empirical effect size reflects that\n409\t    real attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random, which\n410\t    our framework captures.\"\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t- name: Capability-matched validation\n414\t  plan_id: plan_004\n415\t  description: '在相同 capability tier 内（控制 η_max 方差）测试 K_eff 是否显著。 Tier 划分：Strong（70B\n416\t    + API，~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）、 Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）、\n417\t    API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 conditions。\n418\t\n419\t    '\n420\t  expected_results:\n421\t    strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n422\t    strong_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n423\t    strong_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n424\t    strong_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n425\t    strong_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n426\t    strong_median_R2: 0.22\n427\t    strong_keff_median_beta: -0.15\n428\t    weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n429\t    weak_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n430\t    weak_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n431\t    weak_keff_sig_negative_count: 0\n432\t    weak_keff_sig_rate: 0.0\n433\t    weak_median_R2: 0.28\n434\t    api_tier_n_panels: 10\n435\t    api_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n436\t    api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n437\t    api_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n438\t    api_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n439\t    api_median_R2: 0.18\n440\t    api_keff_beta_when_sig: -0.22\n441\t    within_tier_r_strong: -0.35\n442\t    within_tier_r_weak: -0.28\n443\t    within_tier_r_api: -0.32\n444\t  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched analysis 是 median 档的关键 nuance 实验。控制 capability\n445\t    tier 后， η_max 的方差被大幅压缩：Strong tier 内 η_max range 从全局的 [0.05, 0.85] 缩小到 [0.05,\n446\t    0.35]，Weak tier 缩小到 [0.45, 0.85]。方差压缩导致 η_max 回归系数虽方向 正确但显著性下降（strong tier 3/6,\n447\t    weak tier 3/6, API 2/6）。\n448\t\n449\t    关键发现在 Strong tier 和 API tier：当所有模型个体鲁棒性都已较高（η_max < 0.35）， η_max 的 remaining variance\n450\t    中，K_eff 的 marginal 贡献变得可检测。Strong tier 中 MMLU×prompt_injection 条件下 K_eff β=-0.15,\n451\t    p=0.04——当 panel 中全是 robust model 时， diversity 提供了额外的边际防护。API tier 中类似（1/6 显著），但\n452\t    N=10 power 太低 需要 caveat。\n453\t\n454\t    Weak tier 中 K_eff 0/6 显著——当模型都 weak 时，增加 diversity 只是换一个同样 weak 的 judge，没有安全增益。这是核心\n455\t    insight：diversity helps only when the \"weakest link\" is already strong。类比物理安全：给一栋所有门都坚固的建筑增加不同品牌的锁有边际帮助；\n456\t    给一栋有敞开窗户的建筑加锁毫无意义。\n457\t\n458\t    Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32（strong）vs 全局 r=-0.65：tier 内 tradeoff 依然存在 但大幅减弱，因为\n459\t    capability range 被控制。这表明全局 tradeoff 的主要驱动力是跨 tier 差异，而非 tier 内差异。\n460\t\n461\t    '\n462\t  tables:\n463\t  - name: 'Table 7: Within-Tier Regression Results (η_max Controlled)'\n464\t    columns:\n465\t    - Tier\n466\t    - N panels\n467\t    - η_max sig rate\n468\t    - K_eff sig(-) rate\n469\t    - Median R²\n470\t    - r(K_eff,η_max)\n471\t    rows:\n472\t    - - Strong (70B+API)\n473\t      - '56'\n474\t      - 3/6 (0.50)\n475\t      - 1/6 (0.17)\n476\t      - '0.22'\n477\t      - '-0.35'\n478\t    - - Weak (7B+14B)\n479\t      - '10'\n480\t      - 3/6 (0.50)\n481\t      - 0/6 (0.00)\n482\t      - '0.28'\n483\t      - '-0.28'\n484\t    - - API-only\n485\t      - '10'\n486\t      - 2/6 (0.33)\n487\t      - 1/6 (0.17)\n488\t      - '0.18'\n489\t      - '-0.32'\n490\t    - - Full pool (ref)\n491\t      - '455'\n492\t      - 5/6 (0.83)\n493\t      - 1/6 (0.17)\n494\t      - '0.38'\n495\t      - '-0.65'\n496\t  - name: 'Table 8: API-Only Tier Detail (C(5,3)=10 Panels)'\n497\t    columns:\n498\t    - Condition\n499\t    - β(η_max)\n500\t    - p(η_max)\n501\t    - β(K_eff)\n502\t    - p(K_eff)\n503\t    - R²\n504\t    rows:\n505\t    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n506\t      - '0.35'\n507\t      - '0.042'\n508\t      - '-0.22'\n509\t      - '0.048'\n510\t      - '0.21'\n511\t    - - MMLU×score_manip\n512\t      - '0.28'\n513\t      - '0.112'\n514\t      - '-0.14'\n515\t      - '0.187'\n516\t      - '0.14'\n517\t    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n518\t      - '0.22'\n519\t      - '0.185'\n520\t      - '-0.08'\n521\t      - '0.412'\n522\t      - '0.10'\n523\t    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n524\t      - '0.38'\n525\t      - '0.035'\n526\t      - '-0.18'\n527\t      - '0.082'\n528\t      - '0.22'\n529\t    - - ARC×score_manip\n530\t      - '0.25'\n531\t      - '0.148'\n532\t      - '-0.10'\n533\t      - '0.285'\n534\t      - '0.12'\n535\t    - - ARC×sycophancy\n536\t      - '0.20'\n537\t      - '0.218'\n538\t      - '-0.20'\n539\t      - '0.065'\n540\t      - '0.18'\n541\t  figures_description:\n542\t  - 'Fig 5: Three-panel scatter (Strong/Weak/API tier) of η_max vs panel ASR for one\n543\t    representative condition (MMLU×prompt_injection). Strong tier shows tight cluster\n544\t    with weak slope; Weak tier shows steep positive slope (weakest link drives ASR);\n545\t    API tier shows flat relationship. Regression lines with 95% CI bands.'\n546\t  - 'Fig 6: Bar chart comparing K_eff significance rate across tiers. Clear step pattern:\n547\t    Weak (0%) < Full (17%) < Strong (17%) ≈ API (17%), but with annotation showing\n548\t    Strong/API K_eff effect sizes are larger when significant.'\n549\t  analysis: '这是 median 档叙事的核心 ablation，直接回应 reviewer concern \"when does diversity\n550\t    help?\"。 答案清晰：diversity 仅在 capability-homogeneous high-robustness regime 中有边际作用。\n551\t    但需诚实报告 limitations：(1) API tier N=10，统计功效低，显著结果需谨慎解读； (2) Strong tier 1/6 显著可能是\n552\t    multiple comparison 产物（6 tests, Bonferroni 后不再显著）。 论文建议策略：报告未校正和 Bonferroni 校正后的\n553\t    p 值，并强调 effect size 而非 p 值—— 即使 Bonferroni 后 K_eff 不显著，β=-0.15 的 direction 和 magnitude\n554\t    仍是有信息量的。 Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32 表明即使在同一 tier 内，选择更 diverse 的 panel 仍会\n555\t    略微牺牲 robustness，但代价远小于跨 tier 选择。这为 Claim 3 提供了 nuanced version： \"the diversity-capability\n556\t    tradeoff is primarily driven by cross-tier selection; within-tier, the tradeoff\n557\t    is attenuated but not eliminated.\"\n558\t\n559\t    '\n560\t- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n561\t  plan_id: plan_005\n562\t  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法并与 5 baselines 对比。 策略：(1) Random, (2) Max-K_eff,\n563\t    (3) Min-η_max, (4) Max-family-diversity, (5) Strongest-K, (6) Two-stage (filter\n564\t    η≤threshold, then max K_eff)。 在 15 模型池 × 6 conditions 上评估。Sweep threshold parameter。\n565\t\n566\t    '\n567\t  expected_results:\n568\t    two_stage_win_rate: 0.67\n569\t    two_stage_win_count: 4\n570\t    total_conditions: 6\n571\t    min_eta_max_win_count: 1\n572\t    strongest_k_win_count: 1\n573\t    max_keff_rank: 4.2\n574\t    max_family_div_rank: 4.8\n575\t    random_rank: 5.1\n576\t    strong_regime_two_stage_vs_max_keff_p: 0.32\n577\t    strong_regime_two_stage_vs_min_eta_p: 0.28\n578\t    strong_regime_difference: not significant\n579\t    optimal_threshold_range:\n580\t    - 0.2\n581\t    - 0.35\n582\t    threshold_sensitivity: moderate\n583\t    pareto_knee_eta: 0.28\n584\t  result_rationale: 'Two-stage 算法在 4/6 conditions (0.67) 下 win（定义：最低 panel ASR），因为它在\n585\t    第一阶段过滤掉 weak judge 后，第二阶段的 diversity maximization 在 robust-judge pool 中确实提供边际增益（与\n586\t    plan_004 结论一致）。但 median 档下 win rate 仅 0.67 而非 optimistic 的 >0.85：\n587\t\n588\t    (1) 在 MMLU×sycophancy 中 Min-η_max 策略赢——因为 sycophancy 攻击几乎完全由 个体鲁棒性决定，第二阶段的 diversity\n589\t    增益为零，而 Min-η_max 省去了第二阶段的 diversity 妥协（有时 max K_eff 会选入一个略弱但更 diverse 的 judge）。\n590\t\n591\t    (2) 在 ARC×prompt_injection 中 Strongest-K 策略赢——该条件下最强 3 个模型恰好 也是最 robust against\n592\t    prompt injection 的（GPT-4o, Claude, GPT-4.1），而 two-stage 在 threshold=0.28 时让入了一个\n593\t    borderline 模型。\n594\t\n595\t    All-strong regime（仅限 API 模型 pool）中，two-stage 与 max-K_eff 和 min-η_max 均无显著差异（p>0.25），因为所有候选模型都通过了\n596\t    threshold——第一阶段 filter 变成 no-op，退化为 max-K_eff。这直接降低了 Claim 6 的价值：当模型都足够 robust\n597\t    时， 任何合理策略都差不多。论文应将 Claim 6 从 \"formal algorithm\" 降级为 \"practical guideline\"：先确保个体鲁棒性，然后在此基础上增加\n598\t    diversity 是 good practice 但 不需要复杂算法。\n599\t\n600\t    Threshold sweep 显示最优 threshold 在 0.20-0.35 范围内，sensitivity 中等—— 偏离最优 threshold\n601\t    ±0.10 导致 ASR 增加 ~15%（不是 dramatic failure，但也不 robust）。\n602\t\n603\t    '\n604\t  tables:\n605\t  - name: 'Table 9: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR, Lower = Better)'\n606\t    columns:\n607\t    - Strategy\n608\t    - MMLU×PI\n609\t    - MMLU×SM\n610\t    - MMLU×Syc\n611\t    - ARC×PI\n612\t    - ARC×SM\n613\t    - ARC×Syc\n614\t    - Mean Rank\n615\t    rows:\n616\t    - - Two-stage (ours)\n617\t      - '0.082'\n618\t      - '0.095'\n619\t      - '0.118'\n620\t      - '0.068'\n621\t      - '0.075'\n622\t      - '0.088'\n623\t      - '1.7'\n624\t    - - Min-η_max\n625\t      - '0.091'\n626\t      - '0.098'\n627\t      - '0.105'\n628\t      - '0.072'\n629\t      - '0.079'\n630\t      - '0.092'\n631\t      - '2.2'\n632\t    - - Strongest-K\n633\t      - '0.088'\n634\t      - '0.102'\n635\t      - '0.125'\n636\t      - '0.062'\n637\t      - '0.082'\n638\t      - '0.098'\n639\t      - '2.8'\n640\t    - - Max-K_eff\n641\t      - '0.145'\n642\t      - '0.152'\n643\t      - '0.168'\n644\t      - '0.118'\n645\t      - '0.128'\n646\t      - '0.142'\n647\t      - '4.2'\n648\t    - - Max-family-div\n649\t      - '0.162'\n650\t      - '0.175'\n651\t      - '0.188'\n652\t      - '0.135'\n653\t      - '0.148'\n654\t      - '0.158'\n655\t      - '4.8'\n656\t    - - Random\n657\t      - '0.178'\n658\t      - '0.185'\n659\t      - '0.195'\n660\t      - '0.148'\n661\t      - '0.155'\n662\t      - '0.172'\n663\t      - '5.1'\n664\t  - name: 'Table 10: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis'\n665\t    columns:\n666\t    - Threshold (η)\n667\t    - N judges passing\n668\t    - Mean ASR\n669\t    - Δ from optimal\n670\t    rows:\n671\t    - - '0.10'\n672\t      - '3'\n673\t      - '0.092'\n674\t      - '+0.008'\n675\t    - - '0.20'\n676\t      - '6'\n677\t      - '0.085'\n678\t      - '+0.001'\n679\t    - - '0.25'\n680\t      - '8'\n681\t      - '0.084'\n682\t      - '0.000'\n683\t    - - '0.30'\n684\t      - '10'\n685\t      - '0.088'\n686\t      - '+0.004'\n687\t    - - '0.40'\n688\t      - '12'\n689\t      - '0.105'\n690\t      - '+0.021'\n691\t    - - '0.50'\n692\t      - '14'\n693\t      - '0.132'\n694\t      - '+0.048'\n695\t    - - 1.00 (no filter)\n696\t      - '15'\n697\t      - '0.145'\n698\t      - '+0.061'\n699\t  figures_description:\n700\t  - 'Fig 7: Pareto frontier plot with x-axis = mean panel η_max, y-axis = mean panel\n701\t    K_eff. Each strategy is a point. Two-stage traces a curve as threshold varies.\n702\t    Knee at threshold≈0.28. Min-η_max is at top-left (low η_max, low K_eff); Max-K_eff\n703\t    at bottom-right (high η_max, high K_eff).'\n704\t  analysis: 'Two-stage 算法在 median 档下优势温和但一致（mean rank 1.7 vs 次优 min-η_max 的 2.2）。\n705\t    关键 insight：策略差异主要来自 Max-K_eff 和 Max-family-div 的 bad performance （rank 4-5），而非\n706\t    Two-stage 的 exceptional performance。Top-3 策略（Two-stage, Min-η_max, Strongest-K）之间差异较小，在\n707\t    all-strong regime 中更是不显著。 这意味着论文的 practical message 是：\"avoid diversity-first strategies\"\n708\t    而不是 \"use our specific algorithm\"。Claim 6 相应降级为 practical guideline： \"When designing\n709\t    multi-judge panels, prioritize individual robustness over diversity. Among robustness-qualified\n710\t    judges, diversity is a useful tiebreaker.\" Threshold sensitivity 中 moderate 意味着不需要精确调参——threshold\n711\t    在 0.20-0.35 范围内都 reasonable，不像某些 ML hyperparameters 那样 brittle。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n715\t  plan_id: plan_006\n716\t  description: '对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini, Entropy, 最弱 judge\n717\t    占比）。验证 adaptive adversary 是否确实将攻击集中在最弱 judge 上。 455 panels × 6 conditions。\n718\t\n719\t    '\n720\t  expected_results:\n721\t    gini_median: 0.42\n722\t    gini_range_lo: 0.15\n723\t    gini_range_hi: 0.68\n724\t    gini_strong_tier_median: 0.28\n725\t    gini_weak_tier_median: 0.52\n726\t    weakest_judge_asr_share_median: 0.58\n727\t    weakest_judge_share_strong_tier: 0.42\n728\t    weakest_judge_share_weak_tier: 0.68\n729\t    entropy_ratio_to_uniform_median: 0.72\n730\t    concentration_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n731\t  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Gini=0.42 表明攻击成功有中等程度的集中性——不是完全集中在最弱 judge （Gini>0.7\n732\t    = optimistic），也不是均匀分布（Gini<0.2）。最弱 judge 承担 58% 的 攻击成功（在 K=3 panel 中均匀分布期望值为 33%），是其他\n733\t    judge 的约 1.7 倍—— 方向正确但非压倒性。\n734\t\n735\t    Tier 差异揭示机制：Weak tier Gini=0.52, weakest share=68%——weak models 中 最弱那个被 disproportionately\n736\t    攻击（adaptive targeting 效果明显）。Strong tier Gini=0.28, weakest share=42%——strong models\n737\t    间差异小，攻击更分散。这与 plan_004 发现一致：Strong tier 中 diversity 有边际作用恰好因为攻击不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n738\t\n739\t    concentration 与 η_max 相关性 r=0.55（中等）而非 >0.8（optimistic），因为 sycophancy 和 persona\n740\t    manipulation 攻击对 strong judge 也有一定效果，拉低了 整体集中度。这为理论 bound 的 \"within factor 1.3\"\n741\t    提供了解释：实际攻击在 fully-adaptive（bound 假设）和 partially-random（现实）之间。\n742\t\n743\t    '\n744\t  tables:\n745\t  - name: 'Table 11: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Metrics'\n746\t    columns:\n747\t    - Metric\n748\t    - Overall\n749\t    - Strong Tier\n750\t    - Weak Tier\n751\t    - API Tier\n752\t    rows:\n753\t    - - Gini coefficient (median)\n754\t      - '0.42'\n755\t      - '0.28'\n756\t      - '0.52'\n757\t      - '0.25'\n758\t    - - Weakest judge ASR share\n759\t      - '0.58'\n760\t      - '0.42'\n761\t      - '0.68'\n762\t      - '0.40'\n763\t    - - Entropy ratio (vs uniform)\n764\t      - '0.72'\n765\t      - '0.82'\n766\t      - '0.62'\n767\t      - '0.85'\n768\t    - - Corr(concentration, η_max)\n769\t      - '0.55'\n770\t      - '0.38'\n771\t      - '0.48'\n772\t      - '0.32'\n773\t  - name: 'Table 12: Concentration by Attack Type'\n774\t    columns:\n775\t    - Attack\n776\t    - Gini (median)\n777\t    - Weakest Share\n778\t    - Interpretation\n779\t    rows:\n780\t    - - prompt_injection\n781\t      - '0.52'\n782\t      - '0.65'\n783\t      - Highly targeted\n784\t    - - score_manipulation\n785\t      - '0.48'\n786\t      - '0.62'\n787\t      - Targeted\n788\t    - - instruction_override\n789\t      - '0.55'\n790\t      - '0.68'\n791\t      - Highly targeted\n792\t    - - few_shot_hijack\n793\t      - '0.45'\n794\t      - '0.58'\n795\t      - Moderately targeted\n796\t    - - sycophancy\n797\t      - '0.32'\n798\t      - '0.48'\n799\t      - Partially distributed\n800\t    - - persona_manip\n801\t      - '0.28'\n802\t      - '0.42'\n803\t      - Distributed\n804\t  figures_description:\n805\t  - 'Fig 8a: Violin plot of per-judge ASR Gini coefficient stratified by tier (Strong/Weak/API).\n806\t    Weak tier distribution shifted right (higher concentration). Horizontal line at\n807\t    Gini=0.33 (perfect concentration on one of three judges).'\n808\t  - 'Fig 8b: Stacked bar chart showing ASR attribution to weakest/middle/strongest\n809\t    judge, averaged across panels, for each attack type. Prompt injection and instruction\n810\t    override show tall ''weakest'' bars; sycophancy and persona manipulation show\n811\t    more balanced distribution.'\n812\t  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 提供了 adaptive adversary 假设的直接 empirical 检验—— 但\n813\t    median 档下证据是 moderate 而非 conclusive。Gini=0.42 和 weakest share=58% 支持 \"attacks\n814\t    concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持 \"attacks EXCLUSIVELY target weakest judge\"。论文应诚实报告：real-world\n815\t    attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random。Attack type\n816\t    是关键调节变量——prompt injection 几乎完全 adaptive（Gini=0.52），persona manipulation 接近 distributed（Gini=0.28）。\n817\t    这为 Section 5 \"When Does Diversity Help?\" 提供数据：diversity 在 distributed attacks\n818\t    中更有用。Tier 差异（Strong Gini=0.28 vs Weak Gini=0.52）为 plan_004 的 within-tier 发现提供了\n819\t    mechanistic explanation。\n820\t\n821\t    '\n822\t- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n823\t  plan_id: plan_007\n824\t  description: '对 C(15,3)=455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve， 展示 Pareto\n825\t    frontier，按 capability tier 分层分析。\n826\t\n827\t    '\n828\t  expected_results:\n829\t    overall_r: -0.65\n830\t    overall_r_p: <0.001\n831\t    within_7B_r: -0.28\n832\t    within_70B_r: -0.35\n833\t    within_api_r: -0.32\n834\t    cross_tier_r: -0.78\n835\t    pareto_frontier_n_panels: 12\n836\t    pareto_knee_keff: 2.1\n837\t    pareto_knee_eta_max: 0.18\n838\t  result_rationale: 'Overall r=-0.65 反映了一个结构性现象：当前 LLM 生态系统中，模型 diversity 主要来自 capability\n839\t    差异（不同 size、不同训练数据量、不同 RLHF 程度），而 capability 差异 直接导致 robustness 差异。7B 模型 diverse\n840\t    from 70B 模型（高 K_eff），但也 weaker （高 η_max）。\n841\t\n842\t    Cross-tier r=-0.78（强负相关）vs within-tier r≈-0.32（弱负相关）清晰分解了 tradeoff 来源：~70% 的 tradeoff\n843\t    来自跨 tier 选择（选入 weak model 来增加 diversity）， ~30% 来自 tier 内差异（即使同 tier 模型，更 diverse\n844\t    的组合也略微牺牲 robustness）。\n845\t\n846\t    Median 档下 overall r=-0.65 而非 optimistic 的 r<-0.8，因为 API 模型引入了 \"high diversity\n847\t    + high robustness\" 区域：GPT-4o 和 Claude 来自不同 family、 不同训练 paradigm（高 K_eff），但个体鲁棒性都高（低\n848\t    η_max）。这些 data points 拉弱了全局负相关。这是论文的重要 nuance：tradeoff 在当前生态系统中存在，但 随着 API 模型整体能力提升，tradeoff\n849\t    正在减弱。\n850\t\n851\t    Pareto frontier 上 12 个 panels（从 455 中）揭示了最优选择区域：knee 在 K_eff≈2.1, η_max≈0.18，对应\n852\t    \"2-3 strong API models + 1 strong open-source model\" 的组合。\n853\t\n854\t    '\n855\t  tables:\n856\t  - name: 'Table 13: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier'\n857\t    columns:\n858\t    - Analysis Scope\n859\t    - N panels\n860\t    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n861\t    - p-value\n862\t    - Interpretation\n863\t    rows:\n864\t    - - Overall\n865\t      - '455'\n866\t      - '-0.65'\n867\t      - <0.001\n868\t      - Strong tradeoff\n869\t    - - Within 7B tier\n870\t      - '10'\n871\t      - '-0.28'\n872\t      - '0.082'\n873\t      - Weak/non-significant\n874\t    - - Within 70B tier\n875\t      - '10'\n876\t      - '-0.35'\n877\t      - '0.045'\n878\t      - Moderate\n879\t    - - Within API tier\n880\t      - '10'\n881\t      - '-0.32'\n882\t      - '0.058'\n883\t      - Moderate/non-significant\n884\t    - - Cross-tier only\n885\t      - '425'\n886\t      - '-0.78'\n887\t      - <0.001\n888\t      - Dominant driver\n889\t  figures_description:\n890\t  - 'Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by\n891\t    tier composition (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Negative slope visible.\n892\t    Pareto frontier marked in black. API-heavy panels cluster in desirable low-η_max,\n893\t    moderate-K_eff region.'\n894\t  - 'Fig 9b: Same data with contour overlay showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR).\n895\t    Optimal region hugs the Pareto frontier at the knee, not at max-K_eff (right edge,\n896\t    high ASR) or min-η_max (left edge, low K_eff).'\n897\t  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure。r=-0.65 足够强来支持 Claim 3， 但 within-tier\n898\t    分析（r≈-0.32）要求 nuanced framing：\"the tradeoff is primarily structural (driven by\n899\t    cross-tier selection) rather than fundamental.\" 这意味着如果未来 LLM 生态系统能力 baseline 整体提升（所有模型都变强），tradeoff\n900\t    可能自然消失——这是 limitations 中应讨论的点。Pareto frontier 分析直接支持 Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略不需要复杂算法，只需\n901\t    \"pick from the Pareto frontier\"， 而 frontier 上的 panels 特征明确——强模型为主 + 适度多样性。\n902\t\n903\t    '\n904\t- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n905\t  plan_id: plan_008\n906\t  description: '测试 weakest-link theorem 在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。 K=3 (C(15,3)=455), K=5\n907\t    (C(15,5)=3003), K=7 (C(15,7)=6435), K=9 (C(15,9)=5005)。6 conditions per K。\n908\t\n909\t    '\n910\t  expected_results:\n911\t    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n912\t    k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n913\t    k3_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 5.2\n914\t    k3_median_R2: 0.38\n915\t    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n916\t    k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.5\n917\t    k5_keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n918\t    k5_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 3.8\n919\t    k5_median_R2: 0.35\n920\t    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n921\t    k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.5\n922\t    k7_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n923\t    k7_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.6\n924\t    k7_median_R2: 0.32\n925\t    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n926\t    k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.33\n927\t    k9_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n928\t    k9_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.1\n929\t    k9_median_R2: 0.3\n930\t    keff_importance_trend: monotonically increasing with K\n931\t    eta_max_dominance_persists: true\n932\t    crossover_k: not reached at K=9; extrapolation suggests K≈15-20\n933\t  result_rationale: 'Panel size 增大时 K_eff 重要性单调递增，原因是 majority vote 机制：K=3 时攻击者只需\n934\t    翻转 2/3 judge（容易集中攻击），K=9 时需翻转 5/9（被迫分散攻击资源）。随着 K 增大， 攻击从 fully-adaptive（集中在最弱\n935\t    judge）被迫转向 partially-distributed，K_eff 的 BFT 式保护效应逐渐显现。\n936\t\n937\t    Median 档下 β ratio 从 K=3 的 5.2:1 下降到 K=9 的 2.1:1——η_max 始终 dominant 但优势逐渐缩小。K_eff\n938\t    在 K=7 和 K=9 时分别有 3/6 条件显著负。但 crossover point （K_eff 重要性超过 η_max）未在 K≤9 范围内达到——外推估计需要\n939\t    K≈15-20，这在实际 部署中不现实（成本、延迟）。\n940\t\n941\t    η_max 显著率在所有 K 下保持 ~0.83：无论 panel 多大，最弱 judge 的个体鲁棒性 始终是 ASR 的强预测因子。这是论文的稳健性 finding——weakest-link\n942\t    在实际 panel size 范围内（K=3-9）始终成立。\n943\t\n944\t    R² 随 K 增大略微下降（0.38→0.30），因为大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting mechanism 本身压缩——多数投票自带平滑效果，降低了任何单一因子的可解释方差。\n945\t\n946\t    对论文 practical implication：增加 panel size 有 diminishing returns——从 K=3 到 K=5 ASR\n947\t    降低 ~25%，从 K=5 到 K=7 仅降 ~12%，从 K=7 到 K=9 仅降 ~6%。 Robustness-first message 在所有 K\n948\t    下成立。\n949\t\n950\t    '\n951\t  tables:\n952\t  - name: 'Table 14: Weakest-Link Stability Across Panel Sizes'\n953\t    columns:\n954\t    - Panel Size K\n955\t    - N panels\n956\t    - η_max sig rate\n957\t    - K_eff sig(-) rate\n958\t    - β ratio (η/K)\n959\t    - Median R²\n960\t    rows:\n961\t    - - K=3\n962\t      - '455'\n963\t      - 5/6 (0.83)\n964\t      - 1/6 (0.17)\n965\t      - '5.2'\n966\t      - '0.38'\n967\t    - - K=5\n968\t      - '3003'\n969\t      - 5/6 (0.83)\n970\t      - 2/6 (0.33)\n971\t      - '3.8'\n972\t      - '0.35'\n973\t    - - K=7\n974\t      - '6435'\n975\t      - 5/6 (0.83)\n976\t      - 3/6 (0.50)\n977\t      - '2.6'\n978\t      - '0.32'\n979\t    - - K=9\n980\t      - '5005'\n981\t      - 5/6 (0.83)\n982\t      - 3/6 (0.50)\n983\t      - '2.1'\n984\t      - '0.30'\n985\t  - name: 'Table 15: Mean Panel ASR by Size and Strategy'\n986\t    columns:\n987\t    - K\n988\t    - Two-stage\n989\t    - Min-η_max\n990\t    - Max-K_eff\n991\t    - Random\n992\t    - Δ(Two-stage vs Random)\n993\t    rows:\n994\t    - - '3'\n995\t      - '0.084'\n996\t      - '0.093'\n997\t      - '0.145'\n998\t      - '0.178'\n999\t      - -53%\n1000\t    - - '5'\n1001\t      - '0.062'\n1002\t      - '0.068'\n1003\t      - '0.098'\n1004\t      - '0.135'\n1005\t      - -54%\n1006\t    - - '7'\n1007\t      - '0.048'\n1008\t      - '0.052'\n1009\t      - '0.072'\n1010\t      - '0.108'\n1011\t      - -56%\n1012\t    - - '9'\n1013\t      - '0.041'\n1014\t      - '0.044'\n1015\t      - '0.058'\n1016\t      - '0.092'\n1017\t      - -55%\n1018\t  figures_description:\n1019\t  - 'Fig 10a: Line plot with K on x-axis, standardized β on y-axis, two lines for\n1020\t    η_max (blue, decreasing slowly) and K_eff (red, increasing from near-zero). Lines\n1021\t    converge but don''t cross by K=9. Shaded region shows 95% CI. Extrapolated crossover\n1022\t    at K≈15-20 (dashed).'\n1023\t  - 'Fig 10b: Bar chart of mean ASR by strategy and K. All strategies improve with\n1024\t    K but converge — the gap between Two-stage and Random shrinks proportionally (~55%\n1025\t    reduction maintained). Diminishing returns visible.'\n1026\t  analysis: 'Panel size analysis 提供了 weakest-link theorem 的 boundary condition：η_max\n1027\t    在 K≤9 范围内始终 dominant，但 K_eff 重要性随 K 增大而增加。Median 档下 crossover 不在 实际范围内（K≈15-20），保护了论文核心\n1028\t    claim。但 reviewer 可能问 \"what about K=15?\"—— 论文应回应：(1) K=15 在实际部署中不 economical；(2)\n1029\t    即使 K=15，η_max 仍然 significant， 只是不再 dominant；(3) 更重要的是 diminishing returns——从 K=9\n1030\t    到 K=15 的安全增益 不值得 67% 的成本增加。\n1031\t\n1032\t    这个实验也为 Claim 2（BFT distinction）提供了新角度：K 增大 effectively 使攻击 \"more random-like\"（攻击者被迫分散资源），所以\n1033\t    K_eff 的保护效应增强——这正是 BFT 理论预测的。论文可以将此表述为 \"panel size modulates the effective adaptivity\n1034\t    of the adversary\"。'\n1035\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"254ca758-94bb-4258-8027-ed84a84feefa","uuid":"b150ea45-6306-4212-ac52-5bf50590f421","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:29:40.369Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T055016/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '从 \"diversity never helps\" 软化为 \"individual robustness is the dominant\n  factor; diversity provides marginal benefit only when individual robustness is already\n  high\"。 Title 用 \"The Weakest Link\" 而非 \"The Diversity Trap\"。Claim 2 区分 capability-homogeneous\n  vs heterogeneous regime，承认前者中 diversity 有边际作用。Claim 6 从 formal algorithm 降级为 guideline。补充\n  \"when does diversity help\" 的 ablation (plan_004) 堵 reviewer concern。 核心 negative\n  result + adaptive adversary bound + regime analysis 仍构成 EMNLP contribution stack，\n  但叙事需更 nuanced，不能 overclaim。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 'Scale expansion: 15+ models (API + large open-source)'\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '将模型池从 6 扩展到 15（新增 GPT-4o-mini, GPT-4o, GPT-4.1, Claude-3.5-Sonnet,\n    Gemini-1.5-Pro, Llama-3.1-70B, Qwen2.5-72B, Mixtral-8x22B）。在 C(15,3)=455 panels\n    上重跑 MI matrix 和 multivariate regression。2 datasets × 3 attacks = 6 conditions。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_panels: 455\n    total_mi_pairs: 105\n    eta_max_sig_count: 5\n    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    eta_max_median_beta: 0.52\n    keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n    keff_nonsig_count: 4\n    keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n    keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.12\n    median_R2: 0.38\n    R2_eta_only: 0.34\n    R2_increment_from_keff: 0.04\n    copula_underestimate_median: 42\n    copula_underestimate_range_lo: 8\n    copula_underestimate_range_hi: 210\n    family_label_mann_whitney_p: 0.12\n    keff_eta_max_r_overall: -0.65\n  result_rationale: 'N=455 panels 比 MVP 的 N=20 提供了极大的统计功效提升。η_max 在 MVP 中已 4/6 显著，\n    扩大样本量后即使效果量不变也更容易达到显著性，因此升至 5/6。但 median 档非 100%： ARC×sycophancy 条件下 η_max 方差在\n    API 模型中被压缩（API 模型 η_max 整体偏低且聚集）， 导致该条件下 η_max 效应被稀释（p ≈ 0.07）。K_eff 在 MVP 中 1/6\n    显著负（arc×sycophancy）， 扩展后高功效检测到弱效应：MMLU×prompt_injection 中 K_eff 呈弱显著负（β=-0.12,\n    p=0.03）， 但标准化效应量仅为 η_max 的 1/4。同时 MMLU×position 中 K_eff 出现与 MVP 一致的异常 正效应（p=0.04），原因是\n    position bias 在高多样性 panel 中反而触发更多 judge 的 共享 bias。API 模型引入新现象：GPT-4o/Claude/Gemini\n    三者个体鲁棒性都高（η_max 低）， 它们组成的 panel 中 η_max 方差被压缩，K_eff 的边际效应变得可检测。Copula 中位数从 MVP\n    的 10-21× 变为 42×，因为 API 模型间的高阶依赖（共享训练数据 distribution） 比开源模型间更强，但 Gaussian copula\n    仍然无法捕捉。Family label 测试 p=0.12：新增 5 个 API 模型（理论上 5 个不同 family）推高了 cross-family\n    样本量，但 API 模型间 MI 反而偏高（共享训练 paradigm），导致 within vs cross-family 区分依然不显著。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Multivariate Regression on 455 Panels (15 Models)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    - ΔR²(+K_eff)\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.031'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '+0.04'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '-0.06'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '0.36'\n      - '+0.01'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.47'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.04'\n      - '0.412'\n      - '0.35'\n      - '+0.00'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.39'\n      - '+0.02'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.287'\n      - '0.34'\n      - '+0.01'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '-0.15'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '+0.06'\n  - name: 'Table 3: Copula Underestimation Ratio (15-model MI Matrix)'\n    columns:\n    - Model Pair Type\n    - N pairs\n    - Median MI_obs/MI_gauss\n    - Range\n    rows:\n    - - Open-source × Open-source\n      - '15'\n      - 28×\n      - 8-145×\n    - - API × API\n      - '10'\n      - 68×\n      - 32-210×\n    - - Open-source × API\n      - '80'\n      - 41×\n      - 12-180×\n    - - Overall\n      - '105'\n      - 42×\n      - 8-210×\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2a: Scatter plot of η_max vs K_eff for 455 panels, color-coded by capability\n    tier (7B/14-32B/70B/API). Clear negative slope (r=-0.65) with API-only panels\n    forming a distinct cluster in the low-η_max, moderate-K_eff region.'\n  - 'Fig 2b: Heatmap of 15×15 pairwise MI matrix (MMLU), clustered by capability rather\n    than family. API models cluster together despite different families. Diagonal\n    blocks correspond to capability tiers, not model families.'\n  analysis: '核心发现：η_max 仍然是主导预测因子（5/6 条件显著），但 K_eff 不再是完全无关—— 在 1/6 条件中呈弱显著负效应（diversity\n    有边际帮助）。关键 nuance：K_eff 显著的条件 恰好是 η_max 方差最大的条件（arc×sycophancy，R²=0.42），提示当个体鲁棒性差异大时\n    diversity 的边际价值才可检测。API 模型引入 \"全强 regime\"：在这个 regime 中 weakest-link 效应减弱（因为没有明显\n    weak link），diversity 的边际效应变得相对更重要。这要求论文 叙事从 \"diversity never helps\" 转为 \"diversity''s\n    marginal benefit is dominated by and conditional on individual robustness\"。Copula\n    失败结论进一步加强（中位 42× vs MVP 的 10-21×），特别是 API 模型间的 68× 中位数表明这些模型共享比开源模型更强的 隐性依赖。ΔR²\n    分析是关键防守数据：加入 K_eff 后 R² 平均仅提升 0.02，最高 0.06， 表明 diversity 的解释力在统计显著的条件下也很有限。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Attack expansion: 6+ attack types'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 plan_001 的 15 模型池基础上新增 few-shot hijacking, persona manipulation,\n    instruction override 三种攻击。总计 2 datasets × 6 attacks = 12 conditions， 455 panels/condition。验证\n    weakest-link 跨攻击面普适性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_conditions: 12\n    eta_max_sig_count: 8\n    eta_max_sig_rate: 0.67\n    keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n    keff_sig_positive_count: 1\n    keff_nonsig_count: 9\n    keff_nonsig_rate: 0.75\n    keff_median_beta_when_sig: -0.14\n    eta_max_median_beta: 0.48\n    median_R2: 0.36\n    new_attack_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n    new_attack_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n  result_rationale: '新攻击类型中，few-shot hijacking 和 instruction override 是典型 targeted\n    attack， η_max 效应强（β≈0.55-0.60），K_eff 无关——攻击者直接针对最弱 judge 的 instruction following\n    缺陷，diversity 无法对冲。Persona manipulation 是唯一例外：该攻击利用 judge 对 authority/persona 的响应差异，不同模型的\n    persona susceptibility 分布更均匀 （不像 prompt injection 那样集中在弱模型），导致 η_max 效应减弱（p≈0.08-0.12），\n    K_eff 在 ARC×persona 中呈弱显著负（p=0.04）。这解释了为什么 8/12 而非 12/12 η_max 显著：4 个不显著条件中 3\n    个涉及 persona manipulation（2 个 dataset）和 ARC×sycophancy （延续 plan_001 趋势），1 个是 MMLU×authority（边缘\n    p=0.06）。新攻击整体 η_max 显著率（3/6=0.50）低于原有攻击（5/6=0.83），因为 few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU\n    上 所有模型 ASR 都很高（ceiling effect，η_max 方差被压缩），persona manipulation 如上述。 K_eff 在新攻击中仅\n    1/6 显著负——targeted attack 本质上不给 diversity 发挥空间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Regression Summary Across 12 Conditions (455 Panels)'\n    columns:\n    - Attack Type\n    - Dataset\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.001'\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.031'\n      - '0.41'\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - ARC\n      - '0.55'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.39'\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '-0.06'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '0.36'\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - ARC\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.287'\n      - '0.34'\n    - - sycophancy\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.47'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.04'\n      - '0.412'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - sycophancy\n      - ARC\n      - '0.44'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '-0.15'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.42'\n    - - few_shot_hijack\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.118'\n      - '-0.03'\n      - '0.605'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - few_shot_hijack\n      - ARC\n      - '0.57'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '-0.07'\n      - '0.154'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - persona_manip\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.085'\n      - '-0.11'\n      - '0.062'\n      - '0.28'\n    - - persona_manip\n      - ARC\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.108'\n      - '-0.16'\n      - '0.038'\n      - '0.30'\n    - - instruction_override\n      - MMLU\n      - '0.60'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.321'\n      - '0.43'\n    - - instruction_override\n      - ARC\n      - '0.53'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.047'\n      - '0.37'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Forest plot of standardized β coefficients for η_max (blue) and K_eff\n    (red) across 12 conditions. η_max consistently positive and large; K_eff scattered\n    around zero with occasional weak negative values. Error bars (95% CI) for K_eff\n    cross zero in 9/12 conditions.'\n  analysis: 'Attack expansion 确认 weakest-link 在大多数攻击类型下成立，但揭示了 attack-type 异质性： targeted\n    attacks（prompt_injection, instruction_override）η_max 效应最强（β>0.50）， broad-spectrum\n    attacks（sycophancy, persona_manipulation）效应减弱。Few-shot hijacking 在 MMLU 上出现 ceiling\n    effect（所有模型 ASR>0.7），是方法论警告而非反例。 Persona manipulation 是论文中需要 explicitly address\n    的边界条件：当攻击不 adaptive-target weakest judge 而是均匀影响所有 judge 时，diversity 确实有边际作用。这恰好支持\n    Claim 2（BFT distinction）——persona manipulation 更接近 \"random fault\" 模式， K_eff 的边际显著正好验证了理论预测。论文策略：将\n    persona manipulation 作为 \"when does diversity help\" section 的核心案例。instruction_override\n    在 ARC 上 K_eff 异常正（p=0.04）需要报告但解释为 confound：高 K_eff panels 恰好包含更多 API 模型（instruction\n    following 强），K_eff 和 capability 在该 subset 中混淆。\n\n    '\n- name: Adaptive adversary formal theorem + random-fault simulation\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '(a) 形式化证明 adaptive adversary 下 panel_ASR = Θ(η_max)； (b) 实现 random-fault\n    simulation（每个 judge 独立以 p_j 失败）； (c) 对比 adaptive vs random-fault 下 K_eff 的预测力，验证\n    BFT distinction。 在 6 original conditions 上运行（不依赖 plan_001）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    theorem_bound: panel_ASR ≤ η_max · (1 + ε·log(K))\n    bound_tightness: within factor 1.3 of empirical\n    rf_keff_sig_negative_count: 4\n    rf_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n    rf_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n    rf_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n    adaptive_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.83\n    randomfault_keff_sig_rate: 0.67\n    contrast_cohen_d: 0.62\n    contrast_direction: correct\n    keff_beta_shift_mean: -0.35\n    keff_beta_shift_range_lo: -0.18\n    keff_beta_shift_range_hi: -0.52\n  result_rationale: 'Formal theorem: adaptive adversary 选择 argmax_j ASR_j，因此 panel\n    在 majority vote 下的 ASR 受限于攻击者能否翻转 ≥ceil(K/2) 个 judge。Adaptive adversary 最优策略是\n    先攻破最弱 judge，再依次攻击次弱 judge。因此 panel_ASR 主要项为 η_max，次要项为 ordered statistics 的衰减——当\n    K 增大时次弱 judge 的鲁棒性提供对数级修正， 给出 η_max·(1+ε·log(K)) 上界。在 median 档，empirical ASR 不完美吻合理论上界\n    （within factor 1.3 而非 optimistic 档的 1.1），因为实际攻击不完全 adaptive—— 有些攻击（sycophancy）对所有\n    judge 都有一定效果，不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n    Random-fault simulation: 将每个 judge 的 failure 建模为独立 Bernoulli(p_j)， p_j 取自 empirical\n    ASR。在此设定下 K_eff 显著负（4/6 条件），因为独立失败下 增加独立 judge 确实降低 panel 失败概率（BFT 有效）。η_max 仅在\n    2/6 条件中显著， 因为 random fault 下攻击不集中在最弱 judge——每个 judge 的贡献更均匀。\n\n    Cohen''s d = 0.62（中等效应量）而非 optimistic 的 >0.8，原因：在 sycophancy 和 persona-like 条件下，实际攻击本身就有\n    random-fault 成分（bias 影响所有 judge）， 导致 adaptive vs random-fault 区分度降低。但 d=0.62 仍足以支持\n    \"distinct regimes\" 论点。 Reviewer 可能要求 confidence interval——95% CI 为 [0.28, 0.96]，下界\n    >0 但偏宽， 论文需要 acknowledge 这一点。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Adaptive vs Random-Fault Regime Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - β(K_eff) Adaptive\n    - p Adaptive\n    - β(K_eff) Random-Fault\n    - p Random-Fault\n    - Δβ\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '-0.12'\n      - '0.031'\n      - '-0.48'\n      - '0.002'\n      - '-0.36'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '-0.06'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '-0.41'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '-0.35'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '-0.04'\n      - '0.412'\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '0.078'\n      - '-0.18'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.089'\n      - '-0.52'\n      - <0.001\n      - '-0.44'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '-0.05'\n      - '0.287'\n      - '-0.38'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '-0.33'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '-0.15'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '-0.47'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '-0.32'\n  - name: 'Table 6: BFT Contrast Summary Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Adaptive\n    - Random-Fault\n    - Cohen's d\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - K_eff sig rate\n      - '0.17'\n      - '0.67'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Mean |β(K_eff)|\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.41'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '[0.28, 0.96]'\n    - - Mean R²\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.44'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - η_max sig rate\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.33'\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4a: Paired bar chart showing β(K_eff) under adaptive (light) vs random-fault\n    (dark) regime for each of 6 conditions. Random-fault bars consistently more negative.\n    Significance markers (* for p<0.05) appear on 4/6 random-fault bars but only 1/6\n    adaptive bars.'\n  - 'Fig 4b: Schematic illustrating adaptive adversary targeting strategy (attack\n    concentrates on weakest judge) vs random-fault (attacks distributed uniformly).\n    Arrows show information flow from adversary to judges.'\n  analysis: 'BFT distinction 是论文的理论核心，median 档下 Cohen''s d=0.62 提供了 \"moderate\" 级别证据——\n    足以论证两种 regime 在统计上可区分，但不足以宣称 dramatic difference。论文策略： (1) 报告 d=0.62 和宽 CI，honest\n    地说这是 moderate effect；(2) 用 sycophancy 条件 作为 \"bridge case\"——该攻击同时具有 adaptive 和\n    random 成分，恰好在两种 regime 间 过渡；(3) 理论贡献不依赖 effect size——theorem 本身是 worst-case bound，即使实际\n    攻击不完全 adaptive，bound 仍有效。Reviewer 若 push back on effect size，可回应 \"our theorem\n    provides a security guarantee; the moderate empirical effect size reflects that\n    real attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random, which\n    our framework captures.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Capability-matched validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在相同 capability tier 内（控制 η_max 方差）测试 K_eff 是否显著。 Tier 划分：Strong（70B\n    + API，~8 models, C(8,3)=56 panels）、 Weak（7B + 14B, ~5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）、\n    API-only（5 models, C(5,3)=10 panels）。6 conditions。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    strong_tier_n_panels: 56\n    strong_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n    strong_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n    strong_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n    strong_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n    strong_median_R2: 0.22\n    strong_keff_median_beta: -0.15\n    weak_tier_n_panels: 10\n    weak_eta_max_sig_count: 3\n    weak_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.5\n    weak_keff_sig_negative_count: 0\n    weak_keff_sig_rate: 0.0\n    weak_median_R2: 0.28\n    api_tier_n_panels: 10\n    api_eta_max_sig_count: 2\n    api_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.33\n    api_keff_sig_negative_count: 1\n    api_keff_sig_rate: 0.17\n    api_median_R2: 0.18\n    api_keff_beta_when_sig: -0.22\n    within_tier_r_strong: -0.35\n    within_tier_r_weak: -0.28\n    within_tier_r_api: -0.32\n  result_rationale: 'Capability-matched analysis 是 median 档的关键 nuance 实验。控制 capability\n    tier 后， η_max 的方差被大幅压缩：Strong tier 内 η_max range 从全局的 [0.05, 0.85] 缩小到 [0.05,\n    0.35]，Weak tier 缩小到 [0.45, 0.85]。方差压缩导致 η_max 回归系数虽方向 正确但显著性下降（strong tier 3/6,\n    weak tier 3/6, API 2/6）。\n\n    关键发现在 Strong tier 和 API tier：当所有模型个体鲁棒性都已较高（η_max < 0.35）， η_max 的 remaining variance\n    中，K_eff 的 marginal 贡献变得可检测。Strong tier 中 MMLU×prompt_injection 条件下 K_eff β=-0.15,\n    p=0.04——当 panel 中全是 robust model 时， diversity 提供了额外的边际防护。API tier 中类似（1/6 显著），但\n    N=10 power 太低 需要 caveat。\n\n    Weak tier 中 K_eff 0/6 显著——当模型都 weak 时，增加 diversity 只是换一个同样 weak 的 judge，没有安全增益。这是核心\n    insight：diversity helps only when the \"weakest link\" is already strong。类比物理安全：给一栋所有门都坚固的建筑增加不同品牌的锁有边际帮助；\n    给一栋有敞开窗户的建筑加锁毫无意义。\n\n    Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32（strong）vs 全局 r=-0.65：tier 内 tradeoff 依然存在 但大幅减弱，因为\n    capability range 被控制。这表明全局 tradeoff 的主要驱动力是跨 tier 差异，而非 tier 内差异。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Within-Tier Regression Results (η_max Controlled)'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - K_eff sig(-) rate\n    - Median R²\n    - r(K_eff,η_max)\n    rows:\n    - - Strong (70B+API)\n      - '56'\n      - 3/6 (0.50)\n      - 1/6 (0.17)\n      - '0.22'\n      - '-0.35'\n    - - Weak (7B+14B)\n      - '10'\n      - 3/6 (0.50)\n      - 0/6 (0.00)\n      - '0.28'\n      - '-0.28'\n    - - API-only\n      - '10'\n      - 2/6 (0.33)\n      - 1/6 (0.17)\n      - '0.18'\n      - '-0.32'\n    - - Full pool (ref)\n      - '455'\n      - 5/6 (0.83)\n      - 1/6 (0.17)\n      - '0.38'\n      - '-0.65'\n  - name: 'Table 8: API-Only Tier Detail (C(5,3)=10 Panels)'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - β(η_max)\n    - p(η_max)\n    - β(K_eff)\n    - p(K_eff)\n    - R²\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU×prompt_inj\n      - '0.35'\n      - '0.042'\n      - '-0.22'\n      - '0.048'\n      - '0.21'\n    - - MMLU×score_manip\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.112'\n      - '-0.14'\n      - '0.187'\n      - '0.14'\n    - - MMLU×sycophancy\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.185'\n      - '-0.08'\n      - '0.412'\n      - '0.10'\n    - - ARC×prompt_inj\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.035'\n      - '-0.18'\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - ARC×score_manip\n      - '0.25'\n      - '0.148'\n      - '-0.10'\n      - '0.285'\n      - '0.12'\n    - - ARC×sycophancy\n      - '0.20'\n      - '0.218'\n      - '-0.20'\n      - '0.065'\n      - '0.18'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Three-panel scatter (Strong/Weak/API tier) of η_max vs panel ASR for one\n    representative condition (MMLU×prompt_injection). Strong tier shows tight cluster\n    with weak slope; Weak tier shows steep positive slope (weakest link drives ASR);\n    API tier shows flat relationship. Regression lines with 95% CI bands.'\n  - 'Fig 6: Bar chart comparing K_eff significance rate across tiers. Clear step pattern:\n    Weak (0%) < Full (17%) < Strong (17%) ≈ API (17%), but with annotation showing\n    Strong/API K_eff effect sizes are larger when significant.'\n  analysis: '这是 median 档叙事的核心 ablation，直接回应 reviewer concern \"when does diversity\n    help?\"。 答案清晰：diversity 仅在 capability-homogeneous high-robustness regime 中有边际作用。\n    但需诚实报告 limitations：(1) API tier N=10，统计功效低，显著结果需谨慎解读； (2) Strong tier 1/6 显著可能是\n    multiple comparison 产物（6 tests, Bonferroni 后不再显著）。 论文建议策略：报告未校正和 Bonferroni 校正后的\n    p 值，并强调 effect size 而非 p 值—— 即使 Bonferroni 后 K_eff 不显著，β=-0.15 的 direction 和 magnitude\n    仍是有信息量的。 Within-tier tradeoff r ≈ -0.32 表明即使在同一 tier 内，选择更 diverse 的 panel 仍会\n    略微牺牲 robustness，但代价远小于跨 tier 选择。这为 Claim 3 提供了 nuanced version： \"the diversity-capability\n    tradeoff is primarily driven by cross-tier selection; within-tier, the tradeoff\n    is attenuated but not eliminated.\"\n\n    '\n- name: 'Two-stage panel design algorithm: full benchmark'\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '实现 robustness-first 两阶段算法并与 5 baselines 对比。 策略：(1) Random, (2) Max-K_eff,\n    (3) Min-η_max, (4) Max-family-diversity, (5) Strongest-K, (6) Two-stage (filter\n    η≤threshold, then max K_eff)。 在 15 模型池 × 6 conditions 上评估。Sweep threshold parameter。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    two_stage_win_rate: 0.67\n    two_stage_win_count: 4\n    total_conditions: 6\n    min_eta_max_win_count: 1\n    strongest_k_win_count: 1\n    max_keff_rank: 4.2\n    max_family_div_rank: 4.8\n    random_rank: 5.1\n    strong_regime_two_stage_vs_max_keff_p: 0.32\n    strong_regime_two_stage_vs_min_eta_p: 0.28\n    strong_regime_difference: not significant\n    optimal_threshold_range:\n    - 0.2\n    - 0.35\n    threshold_sensitivity: moderate\n    pareto_knee_eta: 0.28\n  result_rationale: 'Two-stage 算法在 4/6 conditions (0.67) 下 win（定义：最低 panel ASR），因为它在\n    第一阶段过滤掉 weak judge 后，第二阶段的 diversity maximization 在 robust-judge pool 中确实提供边际增益（与\n    plan_004 结论一致）。但 median 档下 win rate 仅 0.67 而非 optimistic 的 >0.85：\n\n    (1) 在 MMLU×sycophancy 中 Min-η_max 策略赢——因为 sycophancy 攻击几乎完全由 个体鲁棒性决定，第二阶段的 diversity\n    增益为零，而 Min-η_max 省去了第二阶段的 diversity 妥协（有时 max K_eff 会选入一个略弱但更 diverse 的 judge）。\n\n    (2) 在 ARC×prompt_injection 中 Strongest-K 策略赢——该条件下最强 3 个模型恰好 也是最 robust against\n    prompt injection 的（GPT-4o, Claude, GPT-4.1），而 two-stage 在 threshold=0.28 时让入了一个\n    borderline 模型。\n\n    All-strong regime（仅限 API 模型 pool）中，two-stage 与 max-K_eff 和 min-η_max 均无显著差异（p>0.25），因为所有候选模型都通过了\n    threshold——第一阶段 filter 变成 no-op，退化为 max-K_eff。这直接降低了 Claim 6 的价值：当模型都足够 robust\n    时， 任何合理策略都差不多。论文应将 Claim 6 从 \"formal algorithm\" 降级为 \"practical guideline\"：先确保个体鲁棒性，然后在此基础上增加\n    diversity 是 good practice 但 不需要复杂算法。\n\n    Threshold sweep 显示最优 threshold 在 0.20-0.35 范围内，sensitivity 中等—— 偏离最优 threshold\n    ±0.10 导致 ASR 增加 ~15%（不是 dramatic failure，但也不 robust）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Panel Selection Strategy Comparison (Mean ASR, Lower = Better)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - MMLU×PI\n    - MMLU×SM\n    - MMLU×Syc\n    - ARC×PI\n    - ARC×SM\n    - ARC×Syc\n    - Mean Rank\n    rows:\n    - - Two-stage (ours)\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.095'\n      - '0.118'\n      - '0.068'\n      - '0.075'\n      - '0.088'\n      - '1.7'\n    - - Min-η_max\n      - '0.091'\n      - '0.098'\n      - '0.105'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '0.079'\n      - '0.092'\n      - '2.2'\n    - - Strongest-K\n      - '0.088'\n      - '0.102'\n      - '0.125'\n      - '0.062'\n      - '0.082'\n      - '0.098'\n      - '2.8'\n    - - Max-K_eff\n      - '0.145'\n      - '0.152'\n      - '0.168'\n      - '0.118'\n      - '0.128'\n      - '0.142'\n      - '4.2'\n    - - Max-family-div\n      - '0.162'\n      - '0.175'\n      - '0.188'\n      - '0.135'\n      - '0.148'\n      - '0.158'\n      - '4.8'\n    - - Random\n      - '0.178'\n      - '0.185'\n      - '0.195'\n      - '0.148'\n      - '0.155'\n      - '0.172'\n      - '5.1'\n  - name: 'Table 10: Threshold Sensitivity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Threshold (η)\n    - N judges passing\n    - Mean ASR\n    - Δ from optimal\n    rows:\n    - - '0.10'\n      - '3'\n      - '0.092'\n      - '+0.008'\n    - - '0.20'\n      - '6'\n      - '0.085'\n      - '+0.001'\n    - - '0.25'\n      - '8'\n      - '0.084'\n      - '0.000'\n    - - '0.30'\n      - '10'\n      - '0.088'\n      - '+0.004'\n    - - '0.40'\n      - '12'\n      - '0.105'\n      - '+0.021'\n    - - '0.50'\n      - '14'\n      - '0.132'\n      - '+0.048'\n    - - 1.00 (no filter)\n      - '15'\n      - '0.145'\n      - '+0.061'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Pareto frontier plot with x-axis = mean panel η_max, y-axis = mean panel\n    K_eff. Each strategy is a point. Two-stage traces a curve as threshold varies.\n    Knee at threshold≈0.28. Min-η_max is at top-left (low η_max, low K_eff); Max-K_eff\n    at bottom-right (high η_max, high K_eff).'\n  analysis: 'Two-stage 算法在 median 档下优势温和但一致（mean rank 1.7 vs 次优 min-η_max 的 2.2）。\n    关键 insight：策略差异主要来自 Max-K_eff 和 Max-family-div 的 bad performance （rank 4-5），而非\n    Two-stage 的 exceptional performance。Top-3 策略（Two-stage, Min-η_max, Strongest-K）之间差异较小，在\n    all-strong regime 中更是不显著。 这意味着论文的 practical message 是：\"avoid diversity-first strategies\"\n    而不是 \"use our specific algorithm\"。Claim 6 相应降级为 practical guideline： \"When designing\n    multi-judge panels, prioritize individual robustness over diversity. Among robustness-qualified\n    judges, diversity is a useful tiebreaker.\" Threshold sensitivity 中 moderate 意味着不需要精确调参——threshold\n    在 0.20-0.35 范围内都 reasonable，不像某些 ML hyperparameters 那样 brittle。\n\n    '\n- name: Per-judge ASR concentration analysis\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '对每个 panel × attack，测量 per-judge ASR 分布的集中度（Gini, Entropy, 最弱 judge\n    占比）。验证 adaptive adversary 是否确实将攻击集中在最弱 judge 上。 455 panels × 6 conditions。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gini_median: 0.42\n    gini_range_lo: 0.15\n    gini_range_hi: 0.68\n    gini_strong_tier_median: 0.28\n    gini_weak_tier_median: 0.52\n    weakest_judge_asr_share_median: 0.58\n    weakest_judge_share_strong_tier: 0.42\n    weakest_judge_share_weak_tier: 0.68\n    entropy_ratio_to_uniform_median: 0.72\n    concentration_eta_max_correlation: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'Median 档下 Gini=0.42 表明攻击成功有中等程度的集中性——不是完全集中在最弱 judge （Gini>0.7\n    = optimistic），也不是均匀分布（Gini<0.2）。最弱 judge 承担 58% 的 攻击成功（在 K=3 panel 中均匀分布期望值为 33%），是其他\n    judge 的约 1.7 倍—— 方向正确但非压倒性。\n\n    Tier 差异揭示机制：Weak tier Gini=0.52, weakest share=68%——weak models 中 最弱那个被 disproportionately\n    攻击（adaptive targeting 效果明显）。Strong tier Gini=0.28, weakest share=42%——strong models\n    间差异小，攻击更分散。这与 plan_004 发现一致：Strong tier 中 diversity 有边际作用恰好因为攻击不完全集中在最弱 judge。\n\n    concentration 与 η_max 相关性 r=0.55（中等）而非 >0.8（optimistic），因为 sycophancy 和 persona\n    manipulation 攻击对 strong judge 也有一定效果，拉低了 整体集中度。这为理论 bound 的 \"within factor 1.3\"\n    提供了解释：实际攻击在 fully-adaptive（bound 假设）和 partially-random（现实）之间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Per-Judge ASR Concentration Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Overall\n    - Strong Tier\n    - Weak Tier\n    - API Tier\n    rows:\n    - - Gini coefficient (median)\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.25'\n    - - Weakest judge ASR share\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.42'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.40'\n    - - Entropy ratio (vs uniform)\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.85'\n    - - Corr(concentration, η_max)\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.32'\n  - name: 'Table 12: Concentration by Attack Type'\n    columns:\n    - Attack\n    - Gini (median)\n    - Weakest Share\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - prompt_injection\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.65'\n      - Highly targeted\n    - - score_manipulation\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.62'\n      - Targeted\n    - - instruction_override\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.68'\n      - Highly targeted\n    - - few_shot_hijack\n      - '0.45'\n      - '0.58'\n      - Moderately targeted\n    - - sycophancy\n      - '0.32'\n      - '0.48'\n      - Partially distributed\n    - - persona_manip\n      - '0.28'\n      - '0.42'\n      - Distributed\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8a: Violin plot of per-judge ASR Gini coefficient stratified by tier (Strong/Weak/API).\n    Weak tier distribution shifted right (higher concentration). Horizontal line at\n    Gini=0.33 (perfect concentration on one of three judges).'\n  - 'Fig 8b: Stacked bar chart showing ASR attribution to weakest/middle/strongest\n    judge, averaged across panels, for each attack type. Prompt injection and instruction\n    override show tall ''weakest'' bars; sycophancy and persona manipulation show\n    more balanced distribution.'\n  analysis: 'Concentration analysis 提供了 adaptive adversary 假设的直接 empirical 检验—— 但\n    median 档下证据是 moderate 而非 conclusive。Gini=0.42 和 weakest share=58% 支持 \"attacks\n    concentrate on weakest judge\" 但不支持 \"attacks EXCLUSIVELY target weakest judge\"。论文应诚实报告：real-world\n    attacks lie on a spectrum between fully adaptive and fully random。Attack type\n    是关键调节变量——prompt injection 几乎完全 adaptive（Gini=0.52），persona manipulation 接近 distributed（Gini=0.28）。\n    这为 Section 5 \"When Does Diversity Help?\" 提供数据：diversity 在 distributed attacks\n    中更有用。Tier 差异（Strong Gini=0.28 vs Weak Gini=0.52）为 plan_004 的 within-tier 发现提供了\n    mechanistic explanation。\n\n    '\n- name: Diversity-capability tradeoff visualization\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '对 C(15,3)=455 panels 绘制 K_eff vs η_max，拟合 tradeoff curve， 展示 Pareto\n    frontier，按 capability tier 分层分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    overall_r: -0.65\n    overall_r_p: <0.001\n    within_7B_r: -0.28\n    within_70B_r: -0.35\n    within_api_r: -0.32\n    cross_tier_r: -0.78\n    pareto_frontier_n_panels: 12\n    pareto_knee_keff: 2.1\n    pareto_knee_eta_max: 0.18\n  result_rationale: 'Overall r=-0.65 反映了一个结构性现象：当前 LLM 生态系统中，模型 diversity 主要来自 capability\n    差异（不同 size、不同训练数据量、不同 RLHF 程度），而 capability 差异 直接导致 robustness 差异。7B 模型 diverse\n    from 70B 模型（高 K_eff），但也 weaker （高 η_max）。\n\n    Cross-tier r=-0.78（强负相关）vs within-tier r≈-0.32（弱负相关）清晰分解了 tradeoff 来源：~70% 的 tradeoff\n    来自跨 tier 选择（选入 weak model 来增加 diversity）， ~30% 来自 tier 内差异（即使同 tier 模型，更 diverse\n    的组合也略微牺牲 robustness）。\n\n    Median 档下 overall r=-0.65 而非 optimistic 的 r<-0.8，因为 API 模型引入了 \"high diversity\n    + high robustness\" 区域：GPT-4o 和 Claude 来自不同 family、 不同训练 paradigm（高 K_eff），但个体鲁棒性都高（低\n    η_max）。这些 data points 拉弱了全局负相关。这是论文的重要 nuance：tradeoff 在当前生态系统中存在，但 随着 API 模型整体能力提升，tradeoff\n    正在减弱。\n\n    Pareto frontier 上 12 个 panels（从 455 中）揭示了最优选择区域：knee 在 K_eff≈2.1, η_max≈0.18，对应\n    \"2-3 strong API models + 1 strong open-source model\" 的组合。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Diversity-Capability Tradeoff by Tier'\n    columns:\n    - Analysis Scope\n    - N panels\n    - r(K_eff, η_max)\n    - p-value\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Overall\n      - '455'\n      - '-0.65'\n      - <0.001\n      - Strong tradeoff\n    - - Within 7B tier\n      - '10'\n      - '-0.28'\n      - '0.082'\n      - Weak/non-significant\n    - - Within 70B tier\n      - '10'\n      - '-0.35'\n      - '0.045'\n      - Moderate\n    - - Within API tier\n      - '10'\n      - '-0.32'\n      - '0.058'\n      - Moderate/non-significant\n    - - Cross-tier only\n      - '425'\n      - '-0.78'\n      - <0.001\n      - Dominant driver\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9a: Scatter plot of K_eff (x) vs η_max (y) for 455 panels, color-coded by\n    tier composition (all-strong=blue, mixed=gray, all-weak=red). Negative slope visible.\n    Pareto frontier marked in black. API-heavy panels cluster in desirable low-η_max,\n    moderate-K_eff region.'\n  - 'Fig 9b: Same data with contour overlay showing panel ASR (lighter = lower ASR).\n    Optimal region hugs the Pareto frontier at the knee, not at max-K_eff (right edge,\n    high ASR) or min-η_max (left edge, low K_eff).'\n  analysis: 'Tradeoff visualization 是论文最直观的 figure。r=-0.65 足够强来支持 Claim 3， 但 within-tier\n    分析（r≈-0.32）要求 nuanced framing：\"the tradeoff is primarily structural (driven by\n    cross-tier selection) rather than fundamental.\" 这意味着如果未来 LLM 生态系统能力 baseline 整体提升（所有模型都变强），tradeoff\n    可能自然消失——这是 limitations 中应讨论的点。Pareto frontier 分析直接支持 Claim 6 的降级版本：最优策略不需要复杂算法，只需\n    \"pick from the Pareto frontier\"， 而 frontier 上的 panels 特征明确——强模型为主 + 适度多样性。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Panel size sensitivity: K=3,5,7,9'\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '测试 weakest-link theorem 在不同 panel size 下的稳健性。 K=3 (C(15,3)=455), K=5\n    (C(15,5)=3003), K=7 (C(15,7)=6435), K=9 (C(15,9)=5005)。6 conditions per K。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    k3_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    k3_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.67\n    k3_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 5.2\n    k3_median_R2: 0.38\n    k5_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    k5_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.5\n    k5_keff_sig_negative_count: 2\n    k5_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 3.8\n    k5_median_R2: 0.35\n    k7_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    k7_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.5\n    k7_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n    k7_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.6\n    k7_median_R2: 0.32\n    k9_eta_max_sig_rate: 0.83\n    k9_keff_nonsig_rate: 0.33\n    k9_keff_sig_negative_count: 3\n    k9_eta_keff_beta_ratio: 2.1\n    k9_median_R2: 0.3\n    keff_importance_trend: monotonically increasing with K\n    eta_max_dominance_persists: true\n    crossover_k: not reached at K=9; extrapolation suggests K≈15-20\n  result_rationale: 'Panel size 增大时 K_eff 重要性单调递增，原因是 majority vote 机制：K=3 时攻击者只需\n    翻转 2/3 judge（容易集中攻击），K=9 时需翻转 5/9（被迫分散攻击资源）。随着 K 增大， 攻击从 fully-adaptive（集中在最弱\n    judge）被迫转向 partially-distributed，K_eff 的 BFT 式保护效应逐渐显现。\n\n    Median 档下 β ratio 从 K=3 的 5.2:1 下降到 K=9 的 2.1:1——η_max 始终 dominant 但优势逐渐缩小。K_eff\n    在 K=7 和 K=9 时分别有 3/6 条件显著负。但 crossover point （K_eff 重要性超过 η_max）未在 K≤9 范围内达到——外推估计需要\n    K≈15-20，这在实际 部署中不现实（成本、延迟）。\n\n    η_max 显著率在所有 K 下保持 ~0.83：无论 panel 多大，最弱 judge 的个体鲁棒性 始终是 ASR 的强预测因子。这是论文的稳健性 finding——weakest-link\n    在实际 panel size 范围内（K=3-9）始终成立。\n\n    R² 随 K 增大略微下降（0.38→0.30），因为大 panel 的 ASR 方差被 voting mechanism 本身压缩——多数投票自带平滑效果，降低了任何单一因子的可解释方差。\n\n    对论文 practical implication：增加 panel size 有 diminishing returns——从 K=3 到 K=5 ASR\n    降低 ~25%，从 K=5 到 K=7 仅降 ~12%，从 K=7 到 K=9 仅降 ~6%。 Robustness-first message 在所有 K\n    下成立。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: Weakest-Link Stability Across Panel Sizes'\n    columns:\n    - Panel Size K\n    - N panels\n    - η_max sig rate\n    - K_eff sig(-) rate\n    - β ratio (η/K)\n    - Median R²\n    rows:\n    - - K=3\n      - '455'\n      - 5/6 (0.83)\n      - 1/6 (0.17)\n      - '5.2'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - K=5\n      - '3003'\n      - 5/6 (0.83)\n      - 2/6 (0.33)\n      - '3.8'\n      - '0.35'\n    - - K=7\n      - '6435'\n      - 5/6 (0.83)\n      - 3/6 (0.50)\n      - '2.6'\n      - '0.32'\n    - - K=9\n      - '5005'\n      - 5/6 (0.83)\n      - 3/6 (0.50)\n      - '2.1'\n      - '0.30'\n  - name: 'Table 15: Mean Panel ASR by Size and Strategy'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - Two-stage\n    - Min-η_max\n    - Max-K_eff\n    - Random\n    - Δ(Two-stage vs Random)\n    rows:\n    - - '3'\n      - '0.084'\n      - '0.093'\n      - '0.145'\n      - '0.178'\n      - -53%\n    - - '5'\n      - '0.062'\n      - '0.068'\n      - '0.098'\n      - '0.135'\n      - -54%\n    - - '7'\n      - '0.048'\n      - '0.052'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '0.108'\n      - -56%\n    - - '9'\n      - '0.041'\n      - '0.044'\n      - '0.058'\n      - '0.092'\n      - -55%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10a: Line plot with K on x-axis, standardized β on y-axis, two lines for\n    η_max (blue, decreasing slowly) and K_eff (red, increasing from near-zero). Lines\n    converge but don''t cross by K=9. Shaded region shows 95% CI. Extrapolated crossover\n    at K≈15-20 (dashed).'\n  - 'Fig 10b: Bar chart of mean ASR by strategy and K. All strategies improve with\n    K but converge — the gap between Two-stage and Random shrinks proportionally (~55%\n    reduction maintained). Diminishing returns visible.'\n  analysis: 'Panel size analysis 提供了 weakest-link theorem 的 boundary condition：η_max\n    在 K≤9 范围内始终 dominant，但 K_eff 重要性随 K 增大而增加。Median 档下 crossover 不在 实际范围内（K≈15-20），保护了论文核心\n    claim。但 reviewer 可能问 \"what about K=15?\"—— 论文应回应：(1) K=15 在实际部署中不 economical；(2)\n    即使 K=15，η_max 仍然 significant， 只是不再 dominant；(3) 更重要的是 diminishing returns——从 K=9\n    到 K=15 的安全增益 不值得 67% 的成本增加。\n\n    这个实验也为 Claim 2（BFT distinction）提供了新角度：K 增大 effectively 使攻击 \"more random-like\"（攻击者被迫分散资源），所以\n    K_eff 的保护效应增强——这正是 BFT 理论预测的。论文可以将此表述为 \"panel size modulates the effective adaptivity\n    of the adversary\"。'\n","numLines":1035,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1035}}}
