{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019VmbHo8TgPGoUJ7gqZJat5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 cert_manip_resist_eval 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (6 个)\\n\\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry2**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2v3-regression**: DONE (failed) — \\n- **mvp-step2-keff-contrast**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-22\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n（无）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum** (negative): K_eff is a significant negative predictor of panel ASR specifically for broad-spectrum attacks (verbosity bias, position bias, authority bias) that exploit shared judge biases, consistent across both MMLU and ARC datasets. This validates the attack taxonomy: targeted attacks → η_max dominates; broad-spectrum attacks → K_eff provides additional protection. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry3\\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3** (negative): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry2\\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry2** (failed): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. The SDPI bound η_joint ≤ K_eff · η_max has two factors: K_eff (diversity) and η_max (weakest-link robustness). Step 2 v2 confounded them. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 0 / 负向 3 / 失败 3 / 共 6\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp-step2v3-regression: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry: 训练失败 — unknown\\n- mvp-step2v3-retry2: 训练失败 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WnieoUCZ5nZwCYg9RHLSRT","session_id":"254ca758-94bb-4258-8027-ed84a84feefa","uuid":"e8dc979d-582a-4bbc-9022-bcb3abf8f98a","timestamp":"2026-05-22T06:30:44.364Z"}
